Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you've had it duelist face it\Nall my monsters you thought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.77,0:01:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you've killed have risen from\Nthe grave as invincible zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,that can't be destroyed and as\Nzombies they all gain a field
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,power bonus from the graveyard\Ncome on play your next card joey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This one, Garoozies, go\Nwith five slash strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,adios you clown zombie Not quite,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you dweeb,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,forgot my magic card Call of\Nthe Haunted is still in place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clowns come back to\Nlife And that's not all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Each and every time a\Nzombie monster is killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it will come back to life even\Nstronger and more deadly than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The clown zombie's attack\Npower was originally 1350,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but it gains a 30 % field power bonus from\Nthe graveyard field, so now it's 1755.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And after being brought back\Nto life, it gets another 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.09,0:02:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the math, P-Brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than Garoozies. He can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Clown zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame dagger acrobatic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no sign of Joey. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't take any turns,\Nso where could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this thing off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, don't go\Npicking up any hitchhikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to open my eyes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave us all quite a scare\Nwith that skeleton, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, never mind that, because\Nnow we've got another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, both ways look so inviting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.29,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,well, if Joey got invited\Ndown one of those tunnels,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,then we need to figure out which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find Joey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! My foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I stepped on a switch or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet now. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, now the sound's getting louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but just what's\Ncoming this way? Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do hurry! Do hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that boulder chasing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're downhill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It got Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back. Keep running\Nor it's—oh, no, it's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're trapped. It's a dead end since\Nthere's nowhere to run. I'm gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan you can't punch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A balloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that's a speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody wired that thing for sound,\Nand I'm betting it was Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Bequora?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus spared no expense\Nto scare us half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:05:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I smacked down those zombies, and they\Njust come back even nastier than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I can win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough yet, dweeb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that there's no\Nway to beat Bandit Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Bandit Keith's the best there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.69,0:05:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave your star chips at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose these chips, I get\Naxed from the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I dueled,\NKaiba beat me pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a scared little puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And for Serenity's sake,\NI've got to stay in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to trust in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This card I got from Yugi has pulled\Nmy rump out of the fire before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Like in my duels with Mai and Rex Raptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When I fought Rex, it even\Nfossilized his dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll help me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it can blow\Nthose zombies away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I got to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Time wizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently the dweeb's\Nsmarter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His time magic can age bones\Nhis zombies right into the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Spin time roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, help me. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know time roulette is\Ntotally a game of chance bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all a matter of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So if yours is better, you\Nwon't be wiped out, see? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Time Wizard, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really gonna dig\Nwhat happens next, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his time wizard and flame swordsman\Nwill vanish into a time warp in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the attack power of those monsters\Ngets deducted from Joey's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to play a card or would\Nyou rather defeat yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that I'd take this big a\Nhit if I lost a spin at Time Roulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a free turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw my zombies another tasting morsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't win an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, dragon zombie! Hold it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why just defeat him when you can\Nhumiliate him the way Pegasus did me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef up your zombies and you can\Nwipe them out in a few turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the king of ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin, rise from the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Pump King, the King of Ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Pump King has\Na very special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ectoplasmic Fortification!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecto-who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For the what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ectoplasm is the ghostly substance that\Ngives my zombie monsters their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pump King, as the King of Ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,can pump up their\Nectoplasmic energy and their
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.05,0:08:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points by 10 % each\Nand every turn. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And as their attack power grows,\Nthey become giant zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon zombie, attack\Nwith deadly zombie breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That defense monster was much too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give me\Nsomething stronger to destroy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Armored lizard, defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ectoplasmic fortification!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Power up my zombie army! And attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, well, so much for Armored Lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, you're giving me great advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, just good advice so far, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've got one card\Nthat'll demolish the dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can barely defend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly Soul Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.73,0:09:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wiping them out one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.91,0:09:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon's bad breath is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose another warrior and\Nhis zombies only get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, throw another card\Nfor my monsters to devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some way to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.71,0:09:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Joey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Block him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of duel arena is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in the world did you accept\Na duel in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like I had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three creeps there ganged up on\Nme and forced me into this crazy duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not up to you, chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna stop it, you gotta get past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, are you... Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if you leave the arena, you forfeit the\Nduel and all your star chips belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is illegal anyway. Right, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,When he threw down his star\Nchips, he accepted the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Joey, you're just\Ngoing to have to beat these punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're going to need a\Nlittle added motivation, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey, your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dueling for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:10:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You going to cut and run, dweeb,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,or you going to part with\Nyour star chips the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've had it up to here\Nwith your smart remarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill, who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They call me Bandit Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Bandit Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's the Intercontinental Champion,\Nthe guy that Kaiba told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only lost one Duel Monsters Challenge,\Nand that one was to Pegasus himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder Skull Face there has\Noutsmarted me at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why you ought to just\Npack it up and go home, Tweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've given my little pal\NBones here the perfect strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't beat him with\Nevery card in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to get inside Pegasus'\Ncastle except Bandit Keith and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought your last duel, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to join the other\Nzombies in this graveyard field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A graveyard field?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, play your next\Ncard or rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For your sake, I've got to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, all your hopes and all your\Ndreams will die right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Says you, geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my defenses up\Nuntil I find a way to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you shouldn't\Nbroadcast your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when it's a losing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones has a special card in his deck\Nthat'll render all your defenses useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't possibly do that\Nwith one card. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Stop Defense. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Defense is big trouble, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, any card you try to play\Nin defense mode will activate that trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you still can't stop me from raising\Nthe ectoplasmic power of my zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, all that's left is to snuff\Nthe last monster you have standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly zombie breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,End of the road for you, Tweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nowhere left to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I let you down, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him scare you, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he says, don't\Nquit. Quit? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while Serenity's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes, Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes, where'd this\Ndork get a card that rare?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If all my defenses are blocked, then\NI'll just have to take to the offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes, take out that overgrown pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His attack power is greater than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Fire Blast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Now he can't raise\Nhis monster's attack
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,power any higher And\Nsince Pumpkin was already
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,a ghost from the start\NHe can't use the call
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Haunted to bring\Nhim back Minor setback,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bones, don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you've still got more than enough attack\Npower to polish him off for good Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,okay, boss Go, dragon, zombie,\Nblow red eyes away My red eyes, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even red eyes was no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With that card wiped out,\NI'm all but done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Red eyes, black dragon, up in smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He annihilated my strongest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you, Tweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The only monster card that I've\Ngot left is Battle Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And his attack powers are way too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you going to play or surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, isn't there some way Joey\Ncan beat that little ghoul?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a big jam, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking the zombie\Narmy doesn't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And that trap card\Nblocks all his defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, there is a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a magic card in your deck\Nthat can turn this whole thing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Yugi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you beat Kaiba, but the\Nstrategy I gave Bones is just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend is a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, he's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is... the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the card\NYugi was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shield and Sword is a magic\Ncard that swaps the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and defense points of\Nevery monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can take away the zombie's attack\Npower by flipping it to defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,his monsters won't be\Nable to stop my next card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's my only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle Warrior, in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's the only move you had left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I add this magic card\Ncalled Shield and Sword. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Offensive, defensive, flip!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie monsters have no will of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't defend themselves on this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My zombie's attack power\Nhas dropped to zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And my battle warrior's attack and\Ndefense points switched too, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash those zombie freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Battlefest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With their attack points at zero,\Nthe zombies can't come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See you around, loser. Oh, wait, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Wait up, boss! Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Key,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe next time you'll have\Nthe nerve to duel me face
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-to-face instead of hiding\Nbehind your creepy flunkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel you face to face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The game of duel monsters is all about\Nkeeping your opponents off balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning the duel's all that\Nmatters, not how you go about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that, bandit Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quivering in fear already, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, look, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to drag\NOllie into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't be in such a\Nbig hurry to run off on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that it wasn't your fault, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, as long as he won\Nthe duel, we can forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit you had us worried at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you really came through this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't luck, Joey. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your determination,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,your trust in the cards, and the\Npromise you made to your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what helped you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need two more star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So now can we get out of\Nthis creepy pit? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's gonna stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Daylight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're stuck\Nin that cave for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we gotta have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about what, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your star chips. Zygo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong is that you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But boss, I did exactly what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him, just take him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly the way I planned to get him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least now I know\NI'll get into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate when he gets like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a score to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing weighs a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even get it to budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Push harder, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really trapped in here?
